MyLang REPL. :quit (or Ctrl-D) to exit, :help for help.
>> >> => box(P(x: 1, nx: <none>))
>> => box(P(x: 1, nx: box(P(...))))
>> => box(P(x: 1, nx: box(P(...))))
>> box(P(x: 1, nx: box(P(...)))) 
>> => "[box(P(x: 1, nx: box(P(...))))]"
>> => box(P(x: 2, nx: <none>))
>> => [
     box(P(x: 2, nx: [...])),
     box(P(x: 2, nx: [...])),
     "a string long enough to push the echo past the width"
   ]
>> => box(P(
     x: 2,
     nx: [
           box(P(...)),
           box(P(...)),
           "a string long enough to push the echo past the width"
         ]
   ))
>> => 5
>> >> >> 